from q import *
Q('A1-L060','Countable and uncountable nouns',
 'eu consigo distinguir substantivos contáveis e incontáveis e usar a lot of, much e many.',
 ('Reading · An editorial',text('Less Stuff, More Space',['Many people have **too many things**. In my flat there are **a lot of** books and **many** shoes, but there is not **much** space.','Water, rice and furniture are **uncountable**: we do not say *two furnitures*. We say **a piece of furniture**.','Count what you really need. Give away the rest.'],kicker='OPINION',by='Home Weekly',gloss=[('stuff','coisas'),('furniture','mobília'),('space','espaço'),('give away','doar')])),
 [('The writer has too many things.','T','“too many things.”'),('Furniture is countable.','F','É incontável.'),('The flat has a lot of space.','F','“not much space.”')],
 [('“stuff” means…',['coisas','espaço','sapatos'],0,'stuff = coisas.'),('“give away” means…',['doar','comprar','guardar'],0,'give away = doar.')],
 G('Countable × uncountable',['Tipo','Exemplos','Quantidade'],[['contável','**book, shoe, egg**','**many**, **a few**, **a/an**'],['incontável','**water, rice, furniture**','**much**, **a little**, **a piece of**']],'Contável tem plural (*books*). Incontável não tem plural (*water*).','Não diga *furnitures* nem *an advice*. Diga *a piece of advice*.'),
 [('There are ___ books. (many/much)','many','books é contável.',None),('There isn’t ___ space. (many/much)','much','space é incontável.',None),('I need ___ water. (a little/a few)','a little','água é incontável.',None),('A ___ of furniture. (piece/pair)','piece','a piece of.',None)],
 ['stuff;coisas;I have too much stuff.;Tenho coisas demais.','furniture;mobília;The furniture is old.;A mobília é velha.','shoe;sapato;I have many shoes.;Tenho muitos sapatos.','space;espaço;There is no space.;Não há espaço.','advice;conselho;Good advice.;Bom conselho.','piece;pedaço;A piece of cake.;Um pedaço de bolo.','rice;arroz;I eat rice.;Como arroz.','too;demais;Too much noise.;Barulho demais.'],
 ('Moving out',[('Ana','How many boxes do you have?','Quantas caixas você tem?'),('Leo','A lot. Too many books.','Muitas. Livros demais.'),('Ana','How much furniture?','Quanta mobília?'),('Leo','Not much. A table and a bed.','Pouca. Uma mesa e uma cama.')]),
 [('Say what you have many of.','Diga.','I have many books.'),('Say what you have a little of.','Diga.','I have a little time.'),('Ask: How much…? / How many…?','Pergunte.','How much water? How many boxes?')],
 ('Write 5 sentences with many, much, a lot of.','I have many books. I don’t have much space. There is a lot of furniture. I need a little water. How many shoes do you have?',['Usei **many**','Usei **much**','Usei **a lot of**'],'5 frases'))
