 ('Write 5 sentences about waste.','People throw away a lot of food. I give old clothes to charity. We buy less meat. There are fewer clothes in my closet. Plan your meals.',['Usei **less/fewer**','Usei **give**','Usei **a lot of**'],'5 frases'),
